  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expenditure verification Programme Estimates- FED/2019/ 408-234 for IMPACT- final year, FED/2020/ 415-688 for NAO Final Year and FED/2019/ 412-002 for EAC Joint Response-Third year</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract inherited from multiple actions, related to: Expenditure verification Programme Estimates- FED/2019/ 408-234 for IMPACT- final year, FED/2020/ 415-688 for NAO Final Year and FED/2019/ 412-002 for EAC Joint Response-Third year - This action is designed as a regional response to the various and growing security threats across the EAC region. The overall objective of the action is to prevent and decrease regional and cross border security threats. It builds on existing initiatives with the objective to accompany and extend the development of key synergies and complementarities, fully compliant with the EAC Peace and Security Strategy and Protocol as well as with the EU Policy Framework for Peace and Security in East Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
